# welcome-default (h10-page): the welcome page at rest at 1440 x 900, density
# 2, on a dark system in Arctic Ice, reduced motion (the hero is the still).
# Phase 1 starts on the welcome route by default (no `route` line yet);
# phase 2 opens it with one (h10-t-route).
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
reduced-motion on
wait 2000
shot welcome-default
